Vendored xterm.js stylesheet (https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js).

- xterm-6.0.0.css: synced from node_modules/@xterm/xterm/css/xterm.css
  by `npm run build`. The JS comes from the same npm package through
  the rsbuild bundle, not from a file here.

To upgrade: `npm install -D @xterm/xterm@<ver>`, rename this file to
the new version, and update the <link> in web/index.html.
